{"id":"wheat","name":{"en":"Wheat","ja":"小麦"},"desc":{"en":"When milled, this turns into flour. It really has no other use, but flour is so useful that this plant is grown almost worldwide.","ja":"小麦粉になる前の小麦の姿。この身を白くす り潰すと小麦粉になる。正直、それ以外の使 い道はあんまりないが、小麦粉が万能すぎる ため、世界で一番作られている穀物である。"},"level":3,"locations":[{"id":"outer-islets","name":{"en":"Outer Islets","ja":"外海諸島群"}},{"id":"golden-plains","name":{"en":"Golden Plains","ja":"黄金平原"},"parent":"arland-great-plains"}],"categories":[{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"},{"id":"vegetable","name":{"en":"(Vegetable)","ja":"（食材・野菜）"},"icon":"totori-category-vegetable"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":84}